00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Break-even occurs where modeled revenue equals modeled total cost. It depends on price, volume and cost assumptions.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
With $500 fixed cost and $10 contribution per unit, break-even is 50 units in this simplified example.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Graph interpretation

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
